{"title":"Conditionals type 1-3","puid":"c-eng-11/aol94a","path":"/../c-eng-11/topic-32-common-mistakes/block-02-conditionals/level-07","type":"normal","keyboardLayout":"standardENG","voiceLang":"en","voice":"m2_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f3_2025"},"hint":{"text":"<t-darkgrey><b>Conditional 1</b></t-darkgrey><br><b>if-clause</b>: <m-yellow><i>if</i></m-yellow> + <m-yellow>simple present</m-yellow><br> <b>main clause</b>: <m-blue>will-future</m-blue><br><br><t-darkgrey><b>Conditional 2</b></t-darkgrey><br><b>if-clause</b>: <m-yellow><i>if</i></m-yellow> + <m-yellow>simple past</m-yellow><br> <b>main clause</b>: <m-blue><i>would</i>/<i>could</i>/<i>might</i> + infinitive</m-blue><br><br><t-darkgrey><b>Conditional 3</b></t-darkgrey><br><b>if-clause</b>: <m-yellow><i>if</i></m-yellow> + <m-yellow>past perfect</m-yellow><br> <b>main clause</b>: <m-blue><i>would</i>/<i>could</i>/<i>might</i></m-blue> + <m-blue><i>have</i></m-blue> + <m-blue>past participle</m-blue>"},"trainers":[{"trainer":"listMatchVertical","instruction":{"text":"Connect the matching conditional clauses.","speaker":true,"autoplay":false},"atoms":[{"a":"If I study hard,","b":"I will pass the exam."},{"a":"If I studied hard,","b":"I would pass the exam."},{"a":"If I had studied hard,","b":"I would have passed the exam."}]},{"trainer":"listMatchVertical","instruction":{"text":"Connect the matching conditional clauses.","speaker":true,"autoplay":false},"shuffleAtoms":true,"atoms":[{"a":"You will concentrate better","b":"if you turn off your phone during homework."},{"a":"You would concentrate better","b":"if you turned off your phone during homework."},{"a":"You would have concentrated better","b":"if you had turned off your phone during homework."}]},{"trainer":"gapMulti","gapMode":"write","instruction":{"text":"Fill in the gap of the main clause, using the conditional type&nbsp;1-3.","sound":"Fill in the gap of the main clause, using the conditional type 1-3.","autoplay":false},"ignoreCase":false,"textAlign":"left","shuffleAtoms":true,"atoms":[{"a":"<t-blue><b>to invest, to decrease</b></t-blue> <br><i>possible/realistic condition</i>","b":"If cities ((invest)) in sustainable public transport, urban pollution ((will_decrease)) significantly within a decade.","feedback":{"wrong":"<t-darkgrey><b>Conditional 1</b></t-darkgrey><br><b>if-clause</b>: <i>if</i> + simple present<br><b>main clause</b>: <i>will</i> + infinitive"}},{"a":"<t-blue><b>to reduce, to regain</b></t-blue> <br><i>unrealistic condition</i>","b":"If more people ((reduced)) their digital consumption, they ((would_regain could_regain might_regain)) a healthier sense of focus and time.","feedback":{"wrong":"<t-darkgrey><b>Conditional 2</b></t-darkgrey><br><b>if-clause</b>: <i>if</i> + simple past<br><b>main clause</b>: <i>would</i>/<i>could</i>/<i>might</i> + infinitive"}},{"a":"<t-blue><b>to prepare, to defend</b></t-blue> <br><i>impossible condition</i>","b":"If we ((had_prepared)) better for the debate, we ((could_have_defended might_have_defended would_have_defended)) our position more convincingly.","feedback":{"wrong":"<t-darkgrey><b>Conditional 3</b></t-darkgrey><br><b>if-clause</b>: <i>if</i> + past perfect<br><b>main clause</b>: <i>would</i>/<i>could</i>/<i>might</i> + <i>have</i> + past participle"}}]}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Avoiding common mistakes","path":"/../c-eng-11/topic-32-common-mistakes/topic","puid":"c-eng-11/ogckf1"},"parentBlock":{"title":"Conditionals","path":"/../c-eng-11/topic-32-common-mistakes/block-02-conditionals/block","puid":"c-eng-11/6idk6x"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/Connect the matching conditional clauses.","etag":"d93a-15597"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/Fill in the gap of the main clause, using the conditional type 1-3.","etag":"920e-28413"}],"svgs":[],"lsgs":[],"images":[]},"etag":"da5e-3852"}